    "HOMEPAGE — everything except the slider, news, events, faculty and",
    "publications, which have their own files in this folder.",
    "banners     — the programme / partner logo strip across the very top.",
    "marquee     — the red scrolling notice. Each item is one piece of the",
    "              ticker; `link` and `badge` are optional. Delete every item to",
    "              hide the ticker completely.",
    "placement   — the \"Placement Details\" panel.",
    "initiatives — the \"Innovative Initiatives of IIITK\" logo grid. Four logos",
    "              per row. Leave `link` out for a logo that is not clickable.",
    "tours       — the virtual tour strip at the bottom of the page.",
    "headings    — the titles above the three prose blocks. The wording of the",
    "              blocks themselves is in src/content/home/."
  ],
